---
source: crates/poly-cli/tests/components_cli.rs
expression: "Sandbox::new().stdout(&[\"components\", \"list\"])"
---
flavor      partial
cache       <cache>
offline     false
lock        none (this build embeds no component lock)
web      unavailable  adrlint, malva, markup_fmt, oxc, rumdl, taplo, yaml  [this build embeds no component lock]
python   bundled      python-types, ruff
sql      bundled      sqruff
php      bundled      mago
biome    unavailable  biome  [this build embeds no component lock]
ruby     unavailable  rubyfmt  [this build embeds no component lock]
nix      bundled      alejandra
typos    bundled      typos  (opt-in)
astgrep  bundled      astgrep
misc     bundled      dockerfile, dotenv, graphql, hcl
sh       bundled      shfmt
mcp      unavailable    [this build embeds no component lock]
